  "airbnb.com": "airbnb.com",
  "Airbnb's website is a warm, photography-forward marketplace that feels like flipping through a travel magazine where every page invites you to book. The design operates on a foundation of pure white (#ffffff) with the iconic Rausch Red (#ff385c) — named after Airbnb's first street address — serving as the singular brand accent. The result is a clean, airy canvas where listing photography, category icons, and the red CTA button are the only sources of color.": "Airbnb 的网站是一个热情的、以摄影为主题的市场，感觉就像翻阅一本旅行杂志，每一页都邀请您预订。该设计以纯白色 (#ffffff) 为基础，搭配标志性的劳施红 (#ff385c) — 以 Airbnb 的第一个街道地址命名 — 作为独特的品牌口音。结果是一个干净、通风的画布，其中列出的照片、类别图标和红色 CTA 按钮是唯一的颜色来源。",
  "AirPods Max": "AirPods Max",
  "Airtable": "Airtable",
  "Airtable Blue": "Airtable 蓝色",
  "Airtable Blue (#1b61c9) as primary CTA and link color": "Airtable 蓝色 (#1b61c9) 作为主要 CTA 和链接颜色",
  "airtable.com": "airtable.com",
  "Airtable's website is a clean, enterprise-friendly platform that communicates \"sophisticated simplicity\" through a white canvas with deep navy text (#181d26) and Airtable Blue (#1b61c9) as the primary interactive accent. The Haas font family (display + text variants) creates a Swiss-precision typography system with positive letter-spacing throughout.": "Airtable 的网站是一个干净、企业友好的平台，通过带有深海军蓝文本 (#181d26) 和 Airtable 蓝色 (#1b61c9) 作为主要交互口音的白色画布来传达“复杂的简单性”。 Haas 字体系列（显示 + 文本变体）创建了一个瑞士精确的排版系统，整个系统都具有正字母间距。",
  "Align teams with visual strategic planning tools.": "使用可视化战略规划工具协调团队。",
  "All backgrounds, white buttons, text on dark surfaces.": "所有背景、白色按钮、深色表面上的文本。",
  "All buttons flash PostHog Orange on hover — the brand's signature surprise.": "所有按钮悬停时都会闪烁 PostHog 橙色——该品牌的标志性惊喜。",
  "All buttons use 0px border-radius — sharp corners are non-negotiable.": "所有按钮都使用 0px 边框半径——尖角是不可协商的。",
  "All interactive elements use": "所有交互元素均使用",
  "All pill-shaped — no sharp corners on interactive elements. 40px–100px radius range.": "全部呈药丸形状——交互元素上没有尖角。 40 像素–100 像素半径范围。",
  "All Systems Operational": "所有系统均可运行",
  "All text, solid buttons, all borders. The sole interface color.": "所有文本、实体按钮、所有边框。唯一的界面颜色。",
