  "apple.com": "apple.com",
  "Apple's website is a masterclass in controlled drama — vast expanses of pure black and near-white serve as cinematic backdrops for products that are photographed as if they were sculptures in a gallery. The design philosophy is reductive to its core: every pixel exists in service of the product, and the interface itself retreats until it becomes invisible. This is not minimalism as aesthetic preference; it is minimalism as reverence for the object.": "Apple 的网站是受控戏剧的大师级 - 大面积的纯黑色和近白色作为产品的电影背景，这些产品被拍摄就像画廊中的雕塑一样。设计理念归根结底是：每个像素的存在都是为了产品服务，而界面本身则退缩直至变得不可见。这并不是极简主义的审美偏好；而是极简主义。这是对物体的尊重的极简主义。",
  "Application Delivery": "应用交付",
  "Arguably the subtlest shadow system in modern web design. Dual-layer shadows at 5% opacity signal interactivity without visual noise. If you can see the shadow, it is too strong.": "可以说是现代网页设计中最微妙的阴影系统。 5% 不透明度的双层阴影信号交互性，没有视觉噪声。如果你能看到影子，那就太强了。",
  "Arguably the subtlest shadow system in modern web design. On dark surfaces, shadows shift to higher-opacity blacks to maintain the whisper effect against dark backgrounds.": "可以说是现代网页设计中最微妙的阴影系统。在黑暗表面上，阴影会转变为不透明度较高的黑色，以在黑暗背景下保持耳语效果。",
  "Ash Gray": "灰灰色",
  "Ask questions about your entire repository. Cursor understands project structure, dependencies, and conventions.": "询问有关整个存储库的问题。 Cursor 了解项目结构、依赖关系和约定。",
  "Assignee": "受让人",
  "Asymmetric padding (9px 9px 9px 15px) on primary buttons is intentional. Product-colored buttons follow the same structural pattern but inject their brand color.": "主按钮上的不对称填充（9px 9px 9px 15px）是故意的。产品颜色的按钮遵循相同的结构模式，但注入了其品牌颜色。",
