  "CoinbaseText — 18px / 400 / 1.56": "Coinbase文本 — 18px / 400 / 1.56",
  "Collaboration": "协作",
  "Collaborative design tool. Vibrant multi-color, playful yet professional": "协作设计工具。充满活力的多色，俏皮又专业",
  "Color exists only in hero gradients and product showcases. The interface layer remains strictly monochrome.": "颜色仅存在于英雄渐变和产品展示中。界面层严格保持单色。",
