  "Composio Cobalt": "Composio 钴",
  "Composio's interface is a nocturnal command center — a dense, developer-focused darkness punctuated by electric cyan and deep cobalt signals. The entire experience is built on an almost-pure-black canvas (#0f0f0f) where content floats within barely-visible containment borders, creating the feeling of a high-tech control panel rather than a traditional marketing page. It's a site that whispers authority to developers who live in dark terminals.": "Composio 的界面是一个夜间指挥中心 - 一片浓密的、以开发人员为中心的黑暗，中间点缀着电青色和深钴信号。整个体验建立在几乎纯黑色的画布（#0f0f0f）上，内容漂浮在几乎看不见的边界内，营造出高科技控制面板而不是传统营销页面的感觉。这是一个向生活在黑暗终端中的开发人员低声传达权威的网站。",
