  "Expo's interface is a luminous, confidence-radiating developer platform built on the premise that tools for building apps should feel as polished as the apps themselves. The entire experience lives on a bright, airy canvas — a cool-tinted off-white (#f0f0f3) that gives the page a subtle technological coolness without the starkness of pure white. This is a site that breathes: enormous vertical spacing between sections creates a gallery-like pace where each feature gets its own \"room.\"": "Expo 的界面是一个明亮、充满信心的开发者平台，其构建前提是构建应用程序的工具应与应用程序本身一样精美。整个体验生活在明亮、通风的画布上——冷色调的灰白色(#f0f0f3)，给页面带来微妙的科技感cal凉爽感，但又没有纯白色的鲜明感。这是一个会呼吸的网站：各部分之间巨大的垂直cal间距创造了一个类似画廊的节奏，其中每个功能都有自己的“房间”。",
