  "Minimal 4px border radius throughout -- sharp, utilitarian corners": "整个边框半径最小为 4 像素——尖锐、实用的角",
  "Minimal Border": "最小边框",
  "Minimal border radius (1-2px) -- sharp, engineered corners throughout": "最小边框半径（1-2 像素）——整个角落均经过精心设计",
  "Minimal bordered card with transparent background and subtle border. The interface retreats to let content speak.": "具有透明背景和微妙边框的最小边框卡。界面后退，让内容说话。",
  "Minimal bordered card with transparent background. The interface retreats to let content speak.": "具有透明背景的最小边框卡。界面后退，让内容说话。",
  "Minimal Card": "最小卡",
  "Minimal card elevation": "最小卡高度",
  "Minimal containment with border-based separation. Dark cards use surface color shifts for elevation.": "基于边界的隔离实现最小程度的遏制。深色卡片使用表面颜色偏移来提高高度。",
  "Minimal containment with border-based separation. Depth communicated through surface color shifts.": "基于边界的隔离实现最小程度的遏制。通过表面颜色变化传达深度。",
  "Minimal form presence with warm-toned borders and clean focus states.": "最小的形式存在，带有暖色调的边框和干净的焦点状态。",
  "Minimal functional shadow: rgba(0,0,0,0.1) 0px 4px 12px. Focus states only.": "最小功能阴影：rgba(0,0,0,0.1) 0px 4px 12px。仅焦点状态。",
  "Minimal inputs with subtle borders and blue focus rings. Dark variant uses colorimetric depth.": "具有微妙边框和蓝色对焦环的最少输入。深色版本使用色度深度。",
  "Minimal inputs with subtle borders on the dark canvas. Blue focus rings for accessibility.": "在深色画布上进行最少的输入和微妙的边框。蓝色对焦环方便操作。",
  "Minimal lift for inline elements.": "内联元素的最小提升。",
  "Minimal lift. Fine drop shadow for inline elements.": "最小升力。内联元素的精细阴影。",
  "Minimal radius system — 4px for utility, 32px for buttons.": "最小半径系统 - 实用程序为 4 像素，按钮为 32 像素。",
  "Minimal shadows — borders and surface colors do the heavy lifting.": "最小的阴影——边框和表面颜色完成了繁重的工作。",
  "MiniMax uses a white-dominant foundation with a blue brand spectrum and colorful product card accents. Purple-tinted shadows create subtle brand-colored depth.": "MiniMax 采用以白色为主的基础，搭配蓝色品牌光谱和彩色产品卡装饰。紫色阴影营造出微妙的品牌色深度。",
  "MiniMax uses distinctive purple-tinted shadows for featured elements, connecting the shadow system to the blue brand identity. Neutral shadows at low opacity keep everything feeling light and airy.": "MiniMax 使用独特的紫色阴影作为特色元素，将阴影系统与蓝色品牌标识联系起来。低不透明度的中性阴影让一切都感觉轻盈、通风。",
  "MiniMax uses distinctive purple-tinted shadows for featured elements, connecting the shadow system to the blue brand identity. Neutral shadows at low opacity keep everything light and airy.": "MiniMax 使用独特的紫色阴影作为特色元素，将阴影系统与蓝色品牌标识联系起来。低不透明度的中性阴影使一切保持明亮和通风。",
  "MiniMax's website is a clean, product-showcase platform for a Chinese AI technology company that bridges consumer-friendly appeal with technical credibility. The design language is predominantly white-space-driven with a light, airy feel — pure white backgrounds (#ffffff) dominate, letting colorful product cards and AI model illustrations serve as the visual anchors. The overall aesthetic sits at the intersection of Apple's product marketing clarity and a playful, rounded design language that makes AI technology feel approachable.": "MiniMax 的网站是一家中国 AI 科技公司的干净的产品展示平台，它将消费者友好的吸引力与技术cal 的可信度联系起来。设计语言主要以白色空间为主，给人一种轻盈、通风的感觉——纯白色背景 (#ffffff) 占主导地位，让彩色产品卡和 AI 模型插图作为视觉锚点。整体美感处于 Apple 产品营销清晰度和有趣、圆润的设计语言的交汇点，使 AI 技术变得平易近人。",
  "Mint": "薄荷",
  "mintlify.com": "mintlify.com",
  "Mintlify's website is a study in documentation-as-product design — a white, airy, information-rich surface that treats clarity as its highest aesthetic value. The page opens with a luminous white (#ffffff) background, near-black (#0d0d0d) text, and a signature green brand accent (#18E299) that signals freshness and intelligence without dominating the palette. The overall mood is calm, confident, and engineered for legibility — a design system that whispers \"we care about your developer experience\" in every pixel.": "Mintlify 的网站是对文档即产品设计的研究——白色、通风、信息丰富的表面，将清晰度视为其最高的美学价值。页面打开时采用明亮的白色 (#ffffff) 背景、近乎黑色 (#0d0d0d) 的文本和标志性的绿色品牌口音 (#18E299)，在不占据调色板的情况下标志着新鲜度和智慧。整体氛围是 calm，充满自信，并且经过精心设计，易于阅读 — 一个设计系统在每个像素中低语着“我们关心您的开发者体验”。",
  "Miro": "Miro",
  "miro.com": "miro.com",
  "Miro's website is a clean, collaborative-tool-forward platform that communicates \"visual thinking\" through generous whitespace, pastel accent colors, and a confident geometric font. The design uses a predominantly white canvas with near-black text (#1c1c1e) and a distinctive pastel color palette — coral, rose, teal, orange, yellow, moss — each representing different collaboration contexts.": "Miro 的网站是一个干净的协作工具转发平台，通过大量的空白、柔和的强调色和自信的几何字体来传达“视觉思维”。该设计使用以白色为主的画布，带有近乎黑色的文本 (#1c1c1e) 和独特的柔和色调——珊瑚色、玫瑰色、青色、橙色、黄色、苔藓色——每种都代表不同的协作环境。",
  "Mirror how your content operations team works. Treat content as data with a structured, API-first approach.": "反映您的内容运营团队的工作方式。采用结构化、API优先的方法将内容视为数据。",
  "Mission Name": "任务名称",
  "MISSION OVERVIEW": "MISSION OVERVIEW",
  "Mist Border": "雾境",
  "Misted White 80%": "雾白色 80%",
  "Mistral AI": "Mistral AI",
  "Mistral AI's interface is a sun-drenched landscape rendered in code — a warm, bold, unapologetically European design that trades the typical blue-screen AI aesthetic for golden amber, burnt orange, and the feeling of late-afternoon light in southern France. Every surface glows with warmth: backgrounds fade from pale cream to deep amber, shadows carry golden undertones (rgba(127, 99, 21, ...)), and the brand's signature orange (#fa520f) burns through the page like a signal fire.": "Mistral AI 的界面是一个用代码渲染的阳光普照的风景 — 一种温暖、大胆、毫无歉意的cal欧洲设计，将典型的cal蓝屏AI美学换成了金色的琥珀色、焦橙色和法国南部午后光线的感觉。每个表面都散发着温暖的光芒：背景从淡奶油色渐变为深琥珀色，阴影带有金色底色 (rgba(127, 99, 21, ...))，品牌标志性的橙色 (#fa520f) 像信号火一样在页面上燃烧。",
  "Mistral Black": "米斯特拉尔·布莱克",
  "Mistral Block Gradient: Yellow &rarr; Gold &rarr; Amber &rarr; Orange &rarr; Flame &rarr; Mistral Orange": "米斯特拉尔方块渐变：黄色→金色→琥珀色→橙色→火焰→米斯特拉尔橙色",
  "Mistral Flame": "米斯特拉尔火焰",
