  "Modal and dialog containers use a tighter 8px radius with #333 border. Functional, secondary containment for transient UI.": "模态和对话框容器使用更严格的 8px 半径和 #333 边框。用于瞬时UI的功能性二级收容。",
  "Modal and dialog containers use a tighter 8px radius with #d9d9dd border. Functional, secondary containment for transient UI.": "模态和对话框容器使用更紧密的 8px 半径和 #d9d9dd 边框。用于瞬时UI的功能性二级收容。",
