  "Modern terminal. Dark IDE-like interface, block-based command UI": "现代航站楼。类似黑暗IDE的界面，基于块的命令UI",
  "Modernize and build cloud-native applications anywhere with an open, faster, and more secure foundation.": "借助开放、更快、更安全的基础，在任何地方实现现代化并构建云原生应用程序。",
  "MongoDB": "MongoDB",
