  "NVIDIA": "NVIDIA",
  "NVIDIA AI Enterprise": "NVIDIA AI 企业",
  "NVIDIA Green": "NVIDIA 绿色",
  "NVIDIA Green (#76b900) as pure accent -- borders, underlines, and interactive highlights only": "NVIDIA 绿色 (#76b900) 作为纯粹的重音——仅限边框、下划线和交互式突出显示",
  "NVIDIA-EMEA custom font with Arial/Helvetica fallback -- industrial, European, clean": "NVIDIA-EMEA 带有 Arial/Helvetica 后备的自定义字体 - 工业、欧洲、干净",
  "nvidia.com": "nvidia.com",
  "NVIDIA's website is a high-contrast, technology-forward experience that communicates raw computational power through design restraint. The page is built on a stark black (#000000) and white (#ffffff) foundation, punctuated by NVIDIA's signature green (#76b900) -- a color so specific it functions as a brand fingerprint. This is not the lush green of nature; it's the electric, lime-shifted green of GPU-rendered light, a color that sits between chartreuse and kelly green and immediately signals \"NVIDIA\" to anyone in technology.": "NVIDIA 的网站提供高对比度、技术领先的体验，通过设计限制传达原始计算能力。该页面以纯黑 (#000000) 和白色 (#ffffff) 为基础，点缀着 NVIDIA 的标志性绿色 (#76b900)——这种颜色非常具体，可以作为品牌指纹。这不是大自然的郁郁葱葱；它是 GPU 渲染光的电动、石灰移绿，这种颜色介于黄绿色和黄绿色之间，可以立即向技术领域的任何人发出“NVIDIA”信号。",
  "Oat Border": "燕麦边境",
  "Oat Light": "燕麦淡色",
  "Ocean Blue": "海洋蓝",
  "Off Black": "灰黑色",
