  "Pill-shaped CTAs with coral-red brand color. All interactive elements hover to electric blue.": "丸状 CTAs，品牌颜色为珊瑚红。所有交互元素都悬停为电蓝色。",
  "Pill-shaped everything: buttons, chips, nav items all use 999px border-radius": "药丸状的一切：按钮、芯片、导航项都使用 999px 边框半径",
