  "Pinterest": "Pinterest",
  "Pinterest Red": "Pinterest 红色",
  "Pinterest Red (#e60023) as singular bold accent — never subtle, always confident": "Pinterest 红色 (#e60023) 作为独特的大胆口音 — 从不微妙，始终自信",
  "Pinterest uses minimal shadows — depth comes from photography and warm surface colors.": "Pinterest 使用最少的阴影 - 深度来自摄影和温暖的表面颜色。",
  "pinterest.com": "pinterest.com",
  "Pinterest's website is a warm, inspiration-driven canvas that treats visual discovery like a lifestyle magazine. The design operates on a soft, slightly warm white background with Pinterest Red (#e60023) as the singular, bold brand accent. Unlike the cool blues of most tech platforms, Pinterest's neutral scale has a distinctly warm undertone — grays lean toward olive/sand (#91918c, #62625b, #e5e5e0) rather than cool steel, creating a cozy, craft-like atmosphere that invites browsing.": "Pinterest 的网站是一个温暖、灵感驱动的画布，将视觉发现视为一本生活方式杂志。该设计采用柔和、略带温暖的白色背景，并以 Pinterest 红色 (#e60023) 作为独特、大胆的品牌口音。与大多数科技平台的冷蓝色不同，Pinterest 的中性 scale 具有明显温暖的底色 - 灰色倾向于橄榄色/沙色 (#91918c, #62625b, #e5e5e0) 而不是冷钢，营造出一种舒适、类似工艺的氛围，吸引人们浏览。",
  "Pitch-black canvas with near-invisible white-border containment (4-12% opacity)": "漆黑画布，带有几乎看不见的白色边框（不透明度为 4-12%）",
