  "raycast.com": "raycast.com",
  "Raycast's marketing site feels like the dark interior of a precision instrument — a Swiss watch case carved from obsidian. The background isn't just dark, it's an almost-black blue-tint (#07080a) that creates a sense of being inside a macOS native application rather than a website. Every surface, every border, every shadow is calibrated to evoke the feeling of a high-performance desktop utility: fast, minimal, trustworthy.": "Raycast 的营销网站感觉就像精密仪器的黑暗内部 - 黑曜石雕刻的瑞士表壳。背景不仅仅是黑暗，它是一种近乎黑色的蓝色调 (#07080a)，营造出一种身处 macOS 本机应用程序而不是网站的感觉。每个表面、每个边框、每个阴影都经过cal振动，以唤起高性能桌面实用程序的感觉：快速、简约、值得信赖。",
