  "resend.com": "resend.com",
  "resend.emails.send({ to: 'user@example.com' })": "resend.emails.send({ 至: 'user@example.com' })",
  "Resend's website is a dark, cinematic canvas that treats email infrastructure like a luxury product. The entire page is draped in pure black (#000000) with text that glows in near-white (#f0f0f0), creating a theater-like experience where content performs on a void stage. This isn't the typical developer-tool darkness — it's the controlled darkness of a photography gallery, where every element is lit with intention and nothing competes for attention.": "Resend 的网站是一个黑暗的电影画布，将电子邮件基础设施视为奢侈品。整个页面覆盖着纯黑色 (#000000)，文字以近白色发光 (#f0f0f0)，营造出一种剧院般的体验，内容在空旷的舞台上表演。这不是典型的cal开发者工具的黑暗——这是摄影画廊受控的黑暗，其中每个元素都被有意地照亮，没有任何东西会争夺注意力。",
  "Reserve now": "立即预订",
  "Reserve your ride in advance so you can relax on the day of your trip.": "提前预订行程，以便您在旅行当天放松身心。",
  "Resolve 50% of support questions instantly with AI. No training needed.": "使用 AI 立即解决 50% 的支持问题。无需培训。",
  "Responsive breakpoints with automatic layout adjustments across all devices.": "响应断点，可在所有设备上自动调整布局。",
  "Restrained and muted — dark pills, frosted tags, underline ghosts.": "克制和沉默——黑色药丸、磨砂标签、下划线幽灵。",
