  "Soft diffuse shadow (0px 8px 32px, 50% black). Modals, overlays.": "柔和的漫反射阴影（0px 8px 32px，50% 黑色）。模态、叠加。",
  "Soft diffuse shadow (0px 8px 32px, 70% black). Modals, overlays.": "柔和的漫反射阴影（0px 8px 32px，70% 黑色）。模态、叠加。",
  "Soft diffuse shadow (8px 32px) with a radial cyan gradient halo. Used for highest-emphasis elevated content and feature highlights.": "柔和的漫反射阴影（8 像素 32 像素），带有径向青色渐变光晕。用于最重要的提升内容和功能亮点。",
  "Soft diffuse shadow at 70% opacity with restrained cyan glow. The deeper black makes the glow more pronounced.": "不透明度为 70% 的柔和漫射阴影，带有克制的青色光芒。更深的黑色使发光更加明显。",
