  "Standard content card with 1px solid Border Cream and 8px radius. The default container for features and content sections on Ivory surface.": "标准内容卡，具有 1 像素实心边框奶油色和 8 像素半径。 Ivory 表面上功能和内容部分的默认容器。",
  "Standard content card with 1px solid border-dark and 8px radius. The default container for research articles and feature sections.": "标准内容卡，具有 1 像素实心深色边框和 8 像素半径。研究文章和专题部分的默认容器。",
  "Standard content card with 1px solid charcoal border at 80% opacity and 8px radius. The default container for features, stats, and content on the dark canvas.": "标准内容卡，具有 1 像素实心木炭边框，不透明度为 80%，半径为 8 像素。深色画布上的功能、统计数据和内容的默认容器。",
  "Standard content card with 1px solid charcoal border at 80% opacity and 8px radius. The default container for features, stats, and content sections.": "标准内容卡，具有 1 像素实心木炭边框，不透明度为 80%，半径为 8 像素。功能、统计数据和内容部分的默认容器。",
