  "webflow.com": "webflow.com",
  "Webflow's website is a visually rich, tool-forward platform that communicates \"design without code\" through clean white surfaces, the signature Webflow Blue (#146ef5), and a rich secondary color palette (purple, pink, green, orange, yellow, red). The custom WF Visual Sans Variable font creates a confident, precise typographic system with weight 600 for display and 500 for body.": "Webflow 的网站是一个视觉效果丰富、工具先进的平台，通过干净的白色表面、标志性的 Webflow 蓝色 (#146ef5) 和丰富的辅助调色板（紫色、粉色、绿色、橙色、黄色、红色）传达“无代码设计”。自定义的 WF Visual Sans Variable 字体创建了一个自信、精确的印刷系统，显示粗细为 600，正文粗细为 500。",
